OL,3,GNEWSAWhy are so many more young Scots  
OL,4,Aclaiming disability benefits?          
OL,6,FEvery month, more than 12,000          
OL,7,Fapplications are made to Social        
OL,8,FSecurity Scotland for disability       
OL,9,Fsupport.                               
OL,11,FThe number of Scots receiving these    
OL,12,Fbenefits has risen sharply since the   
OL,13,FCovid pandemic, and is projected to hit
OL,14,Fone million by the end of the decade.  
OL,16,FThis has been driven in part by younger
OL,17,Fpeople and claims for mental health    
OL,18,Fconditions.                            
