OL,3,GNEWSAWhy are so many more young Scots  
OL,4,Aclaiming disability benefits?          
OL,6,FThe cost of the system has been        
OL,7,Fgrowing, posing additional challenges  
OL,8,Ffor Scottish ministers facing a tight  
OL,9,Fbudget settlement.                     
